{% assign kind = section.settings.service_kind | default: 'hub' %}
{% assign service_title = 'Oud fragrance bars & workshops in Toronto and the GTA' %}
{% assign service_intro = 'Explore wedding fragrance bars, corporate scent activations and private fragrance workshops with OUDIE. Based in Mississauga, we welcome inquiries across Toronto and the Greater Toronto Area.' %}
{% if kind == 'wedding' %}{% assign service_title = 'Wedding fragrance bars in Toronto & the GTA' %}{% assign service_intro = 'A wedding fragrance bar invites your guests to discover oud and musk with guidance. Plan the scent selection and presentation around the way you want your celebration to feel.' %}{% endif %}
{% if kind == 'corporate' %}{% assign service_title = 'Corporate fragrance bars in Toronto & the GTA' %}{% assign service_intro = 'An OUDIE fragrance activation brings guided scent discovery to a corporate gathering. Explore an experience for a team occasion, brand launch or hospitality event.' %}{% endif %}
{% if kind == 'private' %}{% assign service_title = 'Private fragrance workshops in Toronto & the GTA' %}{% assign service_intro = 'A private OUDIE workshop centres on guided fragrance exploration and hands-on composition. Bring your group together to learn how notes work alongside one another.' %}{% endif %}
<section class="page-width page-hero experience-hero"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a> / {% if kind != 'hub' %}<a href="{{ pages['oudie-experiences'].url }}">Experiences</a> / {% endif %}<span>{{ service_title }}</span></nav><div class="eyebrow">OUDIE Experiences</div><h1 class="section-title">{{ service_title }}</h1><p class="section-copy">{{ service_intro }}</p><a class="btn" href="#ExperienceInquiry-{{ section.id }}">Inquire about your event</a></section>
{% assign experience_alt = section.settings.image.alt | default: service_title %}
{% if section.settings.image != blank %}<div class="page-width experience-image">{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '390,768,1200,1800', sizes: '100vw', alt: experience_alt }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if kind == 'hub' %}<section class="page-width section-tight"><div class="experience-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Find your format</div><h2 class="section-title">Discovery, or a hands-on creation?</h2><p>A fragrance bar is a guided way to explore and choose scents. A private workshop makes composition the centre of the gathering. Choose the experience that suits your occasion, then discuss the details with our team.</p></div><div class="experience-grid">
<article class="experience-card"><div class="eyebrow">Wedding</div><h3 class="serif">A scent moment woven into your celebration.</h3><p>A wedding fragrance bar invites your guests to discover oud and musk with guidance. Plan the scent selection and presentation around the way you want your celebration to feel.</p>{% if pages['wedding-fragrance-bar-toronto'] != blank %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['wedding-fragrance-bar-toronto'].url }}">Explore wedding experiences ↗</a>{% elsif request.design_mode %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['oudie-experiences'].url }}?view=wedding-fragrance-bar-toronto">Preview wedding page ↗</a>{% else %}<a class="text-link" href="#ExperienceInquiry-{{ section.id }}">Inquire about wedding events ↗</a>{% endif %}</article><article class="experience-card"><div class="eyebrow">Corporate</div><h3 class="serif">Give guests a reason to pause and connect.</h3><p>An OUDIE fragrance activation brings guided scent discovery to a corporate gathering. Explore an experience for a team occasion, brand launch or hospitality event.</p>{% if pages['corporate-fragrance-bar-toronto'] != blank %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['corporate-fragrance-bar-toronto'].url }}">Explore corporate experiences ↗</a>{% elsif request.design_mode %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['oudie-experiences'].url }}?view=corporate-fragrance-bar-toronto">Preview corporate page ↗</a>{% else %}<a class="text-link" href="#ExperienceInquiry-{{ section.id }}">Inquire about corporate events ↗</a>{% endif %}</article><article class="experience-card"><div class="eyebrow">Private</div><h3 class="serif">Make fragrance discovery a shared creative experience.</h3><p>A private OUDIE workshop centres on guided fragrance exploration and hands-on composition. Bring your group together to learn how notes work alongside one another.</p>{% if pages['private-fragrance-workshops-toronto'] != blank %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['private-fragrance-workshops-toronto'].url }}">Explore private experiences ↗</a>{% elsif request.design_mode %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['oudie-experiences'].url }}?view=private-fragrance-workshops-toronto">Preview private page ↗</a>{% else %}<a class="text-link" href="#ExperienceInquiry-{{ section.id }}">Inquire about private events ↗</a>{% endif %}</article></div></section>{% else %}
{% if kind == 'wedding' %}<section class="page-width section-tight experience-detail"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your occasion</div><h2 class="section-title">Plan the guest journey</h2><p>Consider where the bar sits in your reception: a welcome moment, a conversation between courses, or part of the evening celebration. Share your schedule so the team can discuss how fragrance discovery fits alongside the other parts of your day.</p></div><div><h2 class="serif">Details to discuss before your wedding</h2><p>Your venue, guest count and reception timeline help shape the proposal. Ask about space, access, scent choices and any personalisation you have in mind. Confirm the exact inclusions before booking.</p></div></section>{% endif %}{% if kind == 'corporate' %}<section class="page-width section-tight experience-detail"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your occasion</div><h2 class="section-title">Start with the purpose of your event</h2><p>Is the event about introducing a brand, bringing a team together or welcoming clients? Include that goal in your inquiry. It gives the conversation a useful starting point for discussing the fragrance menu and guest interaction.</p></div><div><h2 class="serif">Coordinate the activation with your event team</h2><p>Share expected attendance, venue access and the event schedule. If your brand has presentation requirements, mention them early. Ask what can be accommodated and confirm the scope in the proposal.</p></div></section>{% endif %}{% if kind == 'private' %}<section class="page-width section-tight experience-detail"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your occasion</div><h2 class="section-title">Choose a workshop for your group</h2><p>A workshop gives your gathering a focused creative activity. Describe your group, occasion and experience with fragrance. You do not need to arrive with a finished scent idea; the inquiry helps establish the right format.</p></div><div><h2 class="serif">Prepare for a hands-on gathering</h2><p>Share the location, approximate attendance and preferred date. Ask about the workspace, materials, timing and what participants will make. The proposal should confirm those details for your group.</p></div></section>{% endif %}{% endif %}
<section class="experience-process section"><div class="page-width"><div class="eyebrow">From inquiry to event</div><h2 class="section-title">Plan the experience together.</h2><ol class="experience-grid"><li><h3>Share the essentials</h3><p>Tell us the occasion, city, approximate guest count and preferred date. If something is undecided, let us know.</p></li><li><h3>Discuss the possibilities</h3><p>Talk through fragrance selection, presentation and the guest experience. Confirm timing, venue needs and inclusions.</p></li><li><h3>Review your proposal</h3><p>Availability and pricing are prepared for your event. Review the details with the team before confirming a booking.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="page-width section-tight experience-detail"><div><div class="eyebrow">Toronto · Mississauga · GTA</div><h2 class="section-title">Start with your location.</h2><p>OUDIE is based in Mississauga. Include your venue or city so we can confirm coverage and availability. For events elsewhere in Ontario, Canada or the United States, ask about travel arrangements.</p></div><div><h2 class="serif">Want to join a public workshop?</h2><p>Public event tickets have their own dates and availability. A private-event inquiry does not reserve a ticket.</p>{% if collections['workshops'] != blank %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ collections['workshops'].url }}">Browse workshop listings ↗</a>{% endif %}<p><a class="text-link" href="{{ pages['our-scents'].url }}">Explore OUDIE scents ↗</a></p></div></section>
<section class="page-width section-tight experience-faq"><div class="eyebrow">Before you inquire</div><h2 class="section-title">A little guidance.</h2>
{% if kind == 'wedding' %}<details><summary>Can the bar fit our wedding style?</summary><p>Share your colours, atmosphere and fragrance preferences. Selection and presentation are discussed for your celebration.</p></details><details><summary>Do we need a confirmed venue to inquire?</summary><p>A city and approximate guest count are enough to start a conversation. Add the venue and date when you know them.</p></details>{% endif %}{% if kind == 'corporate' %}<details><summary>Can the experience reflect our brand?</summary><p>Tell us about your audience and brand identity. The team can discuss scent curation and presentation options for your event.</p></details><details><summary>Is this suitable for a drop-in event?</summary><p>Describe how guests will arrive and how much time they may have. The team will discuss whether a fragrance bar or another format is appropriate.</p></details>{% endif %}{% if kind == 'private' %}<details><summary>Do guests need fragrance knowledge?</summary><p>Tell us if your group is new to fragrance. The team will discuss the guidance and format that suit your participants.</p></details><details><summary>How is a workshop different from a fragrance bar?</summary><p>A bar focuses on exploring and choosing fragrances. A workshop is a separate hands-on format for composing a personal scent.</p></details>{% endif %}{% if kind == 'hub' %}<details><summary>Which experience should I choose?</summary><p>Choose a fragrance bar for guided scent discovery during an event. Ask about a private workshop if your gathering is centred on hands-on fragrance composition.</p></details><details><summary>Can I ask about an event outside the GTA?</summary><p>Yes. Include the location in your inquiry so the team can discuss travel and availability for your event.</p></details>{% endif %}<details><summary>What does an experience cost?</summary><p>Pricing depends on your event details. Share your location, attendance and preferred format so the team can discuss options and prepare a proposal.</p></details><details><summary>Does submitting the form confirm a booking?</summary><p>No. An inquiry starts the conversation. Availability, inclusions and booking arrangements must be confirmed with OUDIE.</p></details></section>
<div id="ExperienceInquiry-main">{% render 'experience-inquiry', id: section.id, kind: kind %}</div>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":{{ service_title | json }},"description":{{ service_intro | json }},"provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":{{ shop.name | json }},"url":{{ shop.url | json }}},"areaServed":[{"@type":"City","name":"Toronto"},{"@type":"City","name":"Mississauga"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Greater Toronto Area"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ shop.url | json }}},{% if kind != 'hub' %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Experiences","item":{{ pages['oudie-experiences'].url | prepend: shop.url | json }}},{% endif %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{% if kind == 'hub' %}2{% else %}3{% endif %},"name":{{ service_title | json }},"item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Experiences","settings":[{"type":"select","id":"service_kind","label":"Experience page","default":"hub","options":[{"value":"hub","label":"Experiences hub"},{"value":"wedding","label":"Weddings"},{"value":"corporate","label":"Corporate"},{"value":"private","label":"Private workshops"}]},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image","label":"Authentic experience image"}]}{% endschema %}